  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C6 09}你在说什么。\n这可不是你的东西。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_960.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 07}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}晴天霹雳！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_960.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}小熊明明这么努力……！\n居然连奖励都没有……！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_960.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C2 09}你这家伙……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_960.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 11 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1F 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}只要一点点就好……！\n这可是男人的梦想……！\n小熊想成为帅熊啊啊……！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e820_960.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
